Subject: [PATCH] umi: X55 mobile data stage C: pdp_ip0 (cellular, raw IP,
 point to point) carries IP_HW0; IPv4/IPv6 attached as utun (no cellular
 plumber); status for sweet-telephonyd in kern.sweet_cell_data (0277)

---
